---
layout: layouts/base.njk
lang: en
title: Reisefährten — Fine art prints from travel, nature & wildlife
description: "Reisefährten: limited-edition fine art prints from original travel, nature and wildlife photography. Hand-picked motifs, printed to a high standard."
navActive: start
langSwitchUrl: /
heroImage: /images/hero-startseite.svg
heroImageAlt: "[Placeholder: signature travel or landscape photo]"
heroTitle: Images that carry you back to distant places
heroText: Hand-picked fine art prints from my own travels — landscapes, wildlife and cities, captured along the way and printed as limited editions on premium paper.
introTitle: Welcome to Reisefährten
introText: This is where I collect photographs taken along the way — from mountain ridges to the roadside of an unfamiliar city. Each print comes with a short note on where it was taken and what made the moment worth keeping.
aboutTeaserText: I'm Niclas — out with a camera when everyone else is putting their feet up on holiday. Reisefährten grew out of wondering what should happen to the images that are more than just a holiday snapshot.
closingTitle: Discover more motifs
closingText: From coastal landscapes to wildlife encounters — the gallery grows with every new trip. How a print finds its way to you is all laid out to read at your own pace, once you've found a motif you like.
portraitImage: /images/ueber-mich-portrait.svg
portraitImageAlt: "[Placeholder: portrait or signature shot]"
---
<section class="hero">
  <img src="{{ heroImage }}" alt="{{ heroImageAlt }}">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1>{{ heroTitle }}</h1>
    <p>{{ heroText }}</p>
    <a href="/en/gallery/" class="btn btn--solid">View gallery</a>
  </div>
</section>

<main>

  <section class="section section--tight">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>{{ introTitle }}</h2>
        <p>{{ introText }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section--tight">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Selected works</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card-row">
        {%- for werk in collections.werkeEn | reverse %}
        {%- if loop.index <= 3 %}
        <article>
          <a href="{{ werk.url }}">
            <div class="frame">
              <img src="{{ werk.data.image }}" alt="{{ werk.data.imageAlt }}">
            </div>
          </a>
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0.8rem;">{{ werk.data.title }}</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); max-width: none;">{{ werk.data.place }}{% if werk.data.year %}, {{ werk.data.year }}{% endif %}</p>
        </article>
        {%- endif %}
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="rule">

  <section class="section--tight">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <div class="frame">
            <img src="{{ portraitImage }}" alt="{{ portraitImageAlt }}">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2>Behind the camera</h2>
          <p>{{ aboutTeaserText }}</p>
          <p><a href="/en/about/" class="text-link">More about me and how I work</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="text-align: left;">
      <h2>{{ closingTitle }}</h2>
      <p>{{ closingText }}</p>
      <a href="/en/gallery/" class="btn btn--solid">Go to gallery</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>
